      <h2>Simple process.<br>Zero surprises.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline stagger">
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 01</div>
        <h3>Scope &amp; Quote</h3>
        <p>Clear scope and a transparent quote. No hidden costs, no vague line items. You know what you are paying for before we pick up a single tool.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 02</div>
        <h3>Plan &amp; Schedule</h3>
        <p>Detailed project plan with every milestone mapped and every trade accounted for. You see the full picture upfront.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 03</div>
        <h3>Execute &amp; Update</h3>
        <p>We get to work and keep you in the loop with structured updates. You will never have to chase us for a status report.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 04</div>
        <h3>Deliver &amp; Close</h3>
